        "page_heading": "THE NEURO-COACHING CONSOLE",
        "file_label": "// FILE: 037",
        "heading": "THE BRAIN SECRET (Auditory Filtering)",
        "science_label": "The Science:",
        "science": "Your brain is an absolute master at 'filtering' (Selective Attention and Sensory Gating). It can block out background noise (like your parents talking) to focus entirely on what matters to you (like a game). It's a feature, not a bug! But you have to break the filter to get data in.",
        "in_story_label": "In The Story:",
        "in_story": "Dilo was watching a gaming video and Nini was singing opera. Mimi's warnings were just background noise; their brains were officially in 'Airplane Mode'."
      }
    },
