        "science": "You cannot download a file on bad Wi-Fi. You need Proximity, Connection, and a Locked Signal (Eye Contact).",
        "in_story_label": "In The Story:",
        "in_story": "Mimi had to make Dilo look into her eyes and actually ECHO the mission out loud to confirm the download."
      }
    },
