        "body": "Why is Eye Contact so powerful? When you lock eyes with someone, your brains literally sync up! Neural oscillations (brain waves) in the speaker and the listener start to match. It's the biological equivalent of connecting two devices via Bluetooth. Without that visual connection, the message just bounces off!"
